# Zeres MID Register — environment
# No secrets are required to run the app today. This file documents the shape
# for when one is needed (e.g. a Drive or SharePoint credential in a later phase).
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored and must never be committed.

# ZERES_REGISTER_PATH=/path/to/Zeres_MID_Register.xlsx
# ZERES_DRIVE_ROOT=/Users/you/Zeres Drive
